@startuml tailscale-vip-drop-before-fix
participant "Mobile 4G\n100.64.0.5" as Mobile
participant "Connector pod\n10.0.1.22 (own netns)" as Pod
participant "Cilium TCX\nfrom-endpoint hook" as TCX
participant "Node netns\n192.168.0.102" as Node

Mobile -> Pod : WireGuard, decapsulated\ninner src=100.64.0.5 dst=192.168.10.2
Pod -> Pod : Tailscale SNAT\nsrc=100.64.0.5 -> src=10.0.1.22
Pod -> TCX : exits via eth0 (tun-injected,\nno connect() syscall -\ncgroup socket BPF never fires)

TCX -> TCX : lookup dst=192.168.10.2 in service map\nbpf-lb-external-clusterip: false\n-> LoadBalancer external IPs excluded\n-> NO DNAT applied
TCX -> Node : still dst=192.168.10.2 (unchanged)

Node -> Node : no local route for 192.168.10.2\n-> default route -> wlp0s20f3 (WiFi)
Node -x Node : ARP "who has 192.168.10.2?"\nno useful reply on the wire
note right of Node
  *** PACKET DROPPED ***
  Mobile sees ERR_CONNECTION_TIMED_OUT
end note
@enduml
